### ===== 장바구니 항목 추가 =====

### 장바구니 항목 추가
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### 장바구니 항목 추가 - 다른 상품
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

{
  "productId": 2,
  "quantity": 1
}

### 장바구니 항목 추가 실패 - 수량 0 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 0
}

### 장바구니 항목 추가 실패 - 인증 헤더 없음 (401)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 1
}


### ===== 장바구니 항목 수량 변경 =====

### 수량 변경
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/items/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

{
  "quantity": 5
}

### 수량 변경 실패 - 존재하지 않는 항목 (404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/items/99999
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

{
  "quantity": 3
}


### ===== 장바구니 항목 삭제 =====

### 항목 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/items/1
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

### 항목 삭제 실패 - 존재하지 않는 항목 (404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/items/99999
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!


### ===== 장바구니 항목 선택 상태 변경 =====

### 선택 상태 변경 (항목 1만 선택)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/items/selection
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

{
  "selectedCartItemIds": [1]
}

### 선택 상태 변경 (전체 선택)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/items/selection
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

{
  "selectedCartItemIds": [1, 2]
}


### ===== 장바구니 조회 =====

### 장바구니 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

### 장바구니 상태 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/status
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

### 장바구니 조회 실패 - 인증 헤더 없음 (401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart
